(17,482 real changes made)

.         replace haskids=1 if haskids>0
(17,746 real changes made)

. 
.         *Left-leaning preferences
.         gen partyid=0

.         replace partyid=1 if plh0012_h==1|plh0012_h==6|plh0012_h==5
